<title>NEW ZEALAND: Transmark recommends higher Gandava bid.</title>
<headline>Transmark recommends higher Gandava bid.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The independent directors of Transmark Corp Ltd on Friday recommended shareholders accept Gandava's increased offer.</p>
<p>Earlier, Gandava Investments Ltd lifted its bid for the company's shares to NZ$1.95 per share from $1.60.  </p>
<p>The offer is open until November 21.</p>
<p>Gandava has agreed with the independent directors that this date will not be further extended unless the offer is unconditional.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
